      "title": "Iran’s Revolutionary Guards ‘almost certainly’ behind RAF Fairford threats, says Burnham",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/12/iran-revolutionary-guards-irgc-raf-fairford-threats",
      "description": "<p>UK to bring further sanctions against Tehran and IRGC after assessment Iran was likely to have coordinated incident</p><p>Andy Burnham said Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps were “almost certainly” behind threats to RAF Fairford, the firmest attribution of responsibility made so far by the UK after an incident late last month.</p><p>The prime minister told MPs the UK would bring further sanctions against Tehran and the IRGC in the aftermath of an ambiguous episode that, despite over a fortnight of police investigation, has yet to lead to anybody being charged.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/12/iran-revolutionary-guards-irgc-raf-fairford-threats\">Continue reading...</a>",
